---
import SiteLayout from "../../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import pages from "../../../data/pages.json";
import PageHeader from "../../../components/PageHeader.astro";
import AccordionPanel from "../../../components/AccordionPanel.astro";
const page = pages["/staff-member/paula-marina-waller-moreno/"];
---
<SiteLayout page={page}>
<main class="site-main wpex-clr" id="main">
<PageHeader attributes={{"class": "page-header centered-page-header has-bg-image bg-fixed wpex-bg-fixed wpex-bg-cover wpex-bg-center wpex-bg-no-repeat wpex-relative wpex-mb-40 wpex-surface-2 wpex-py-30 wpex-border-t wpex-border-b wpex-border-solid wpex-border-surface-3 wpex-text-2 wpex-text-center wpex-supports-mods"}}>
<div class="page-header-inner container">
<div class="page-header-content">
<h1 class="page-header-title wpex-block wpex-m-0 wpex-text-5xl">
<span>PAULA MARINA WALLER MORENO</span>
</h1>
</div></div>
</PageHeader>
<div class="container wpex-clr" id="content-wrap">
<div class="content-area wpex-clr" id="primary">
<div class="site-content wpex-clr" id="content">
<div class="wpex-first-mt-0 wpex-clr" id="single-blocks">
<article class="single-content wpex-mt-20 entry wpex-clr" id="staff-single-content"><div class="wpb-content-wrapper"><div class="vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid"><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><figure class="vcex-image vcex-module"><div class="vcex-image-inner wpex-relative wpex-inline-block"><img alt="" class="vcex-image-img wpex-align-middle" decoding="async" height="613" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 613px) 100vw, 613px" src="/assets/uploads/2021/10/fot-paula.png" srcset="/assets/uploads/2021/10/fot-paula.png 613w, /assets/uploads/2021/10/fot-paula-300x300.png 300w, /assets/uploads/2021/10/fot-paula-150x150.png 150w" width="613" /></div></figure></div></div></div><div class="wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-9"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper">
<div class="wpb_text_column has-custom-color wpex-child-inherit-color wpb_content_element" style="color:#c3004f;letter-spacing:var(--wpex-tracking-widest);text-align:center;text-transform:uppercase;">
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<p style="text-align: center;"><strong>Asociada</strong></p>
</div>
</div>
<style is:inline> style="height:15px;"</style><div class="vcex-spacing wpex-w-100 wpex-clear" style="height:15px;"></div><div class="vcex-module vcex-divider vcex-divider-solid vcex-divider-center wpex-mx-auto wpex-block wpex-h-0 wpex-border-b wpex-border-solid wpex-border-main" style="border-color:#ca0043;"></div><style is:inline> style="height:15px;"</style><div class="vcex-spacing wpex-w-100 wpex-clear" style="height:15px;"></div>
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element">
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="mailto:marina.waller@camya.mx">marina.waller@camya.mx</a></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">En CAMYA, nuestro equipo está formado por abogados apasionados y especializados. Con formación académica excepcional y experiencia diversa, nos enorgullece ofrecer soluciones legales innovadoras. Nos comprometemos a ser su socio de confianza, brindándole servicios de calidad que van más allá de lo convencional.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="vcex-spacing wpex-w-100 wpex-clear"></div><div class="vc_tta-container" data-vc-action="collapseAll"><div class="vc_general vc_tta vc_tta-accordion vc_tta-color-grey vc_tta-style-flat vc_tta-shape-rounded vc_tta-o-shape-group vc_tta-controls-align-default vc_tta-o-no-fill vc_tta-o-all-clickable"><div class="vc_tta-panels-container"><div class="vc_tta-panels"><AccordionPanel attributes={{"class": "vc_tta-panel", "data-vc-content": ".vc_tta-panel-body", "id": "1553621815016-3d27d9bc-6e5b1704250734320"}} bodyAttributes={{"class": "vc_tta-panel-body"}}><Fragment slot="heading"><div class="vc_tta-panel-heading"><h4 class="vc_tta-panel-title vc_tta-controls-icon-position-left"><a data-vc-accordion="" data-vc-container=".vc_tta-container" href="#1553621815016-3d27d9bc-6e5b1704250734320"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">Principales Áreas de Práctica</span><i class="vc_tta-controls-icon vc_tta-controls-icon-plus"></i></a></h4></div></Fragment>
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element">
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<p style="text-align: justify;">Asesoría, consultoría y litigio civil, mercantil y familiar, focalizado en controversias de daño moral, recuperación de créditos, juicios hipotecarios y ejecutivos mercantiles.</p>
</div>
</div>
</AccordionPanel><AccordionPanel attributes={{"class": "vc_tta-panel", "data-vc-content": ".vc_tta-panel-body", "id": "1553621815244-9b2c1671-f9ab1704250734320"}} bodyAttributes={{"class": "vc_tta-panel-body"}}><Fragment slot="heading"><div class="vc_tta-panel-heading"><h4 class="vc_tta-panel-title vc_tta-controls-icon-position-left"><a data-vc-accordion="" data-vc-container=".vc_tta-container" href="#1553621815244-9b2c1671-f9ab1704250734320"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">Educación</span><i class="vc_tta-controls-icon vc_tta-controls-icon-plus"></i></a></h4></div></Fragment>
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element">
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<p style="text-align: justify;">Licenciada en Derecho (2019) y Especialista en Derecho de Amparo (2020) por la Universidad Panamericana.</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">Certificación en idioma inglés “<em>Cambridge Certificate in Advaced English</em>” y en idioma holandés “<em>Joost Weet Het</em>”.</p>
</div>
</div>
</AccordionPanel><AccordionPanel attributes={{"class": "vc_tta-panel", "data-vc-content": ".vc_tta-panel-body", "id": "1635384253358-8694ebe8-e7a91704250734320"}} bodyAttributes={{"class": "vc_tta-panel-body"}}><Fragment slot="heading"><div class="vc_tta-panel-heading"><h4 class="vc_tta-panel-title vc_tta-controls-icon-position-left"><a data-vc-accordion="" data-vc-container=".vc_tta-container" href="#1635384253358-8694ebe8-e7a91704250734320"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">Trayectoria Profesional</span><i class="vc_tta-controls-icon vc_tta-controls-icon-plus"></i></a></h4></div></Fragment>
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element">
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<p style="text-align: justify;">La licenciada Waller se desempeñó previamente en el área de litigio civil y mercantil del despacho Casas y Leyva Abogados, S.C., en la práctica de derecho corporativo en elaboración de contratos, actas societarias, traducciones, etc., en Chacón y Rodríguez, S.C., y en el área contenciosa del Servicio de Administración y Enajenación de Inmuebles (ahora Instituto para Devolver al Pueblo lo Robado).</p>
</div>
</div>
</AccordionPanel><AccordionPanel attributes={{"class": "vc_tta-panel", "data-vc-content": ".vc_tta-panel-body", "id": "1553621815467-44e38ae2-22811704250734320"}} bodyAttributes={{"class": "vc_tta-panel-body"}}><Fragment slot="heading"><div class="vc_tta-panel-heading"><h4 class="vc_tta-panel-title vc_tta-controls-icon-position-left"><a data-vc-accordion="" data-vc-container=".vc_tta-container" href="#1553621815467-44e38ae2-22811704250734320"><span class="vc_tta-title-text">Idiomas</span><i class="vc_tta-controls-icon vc_tta-controls-icon-plus"></i></a></h4></div></Fragment>
<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element">
<div class="wpb_wrapper">
<p>Español e inglés.</p>
</div>
</div>
</AccordionPanel></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>
</div></article>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</main>
</SiteLayout>
